<body>

  <header>
    <h1>Simple Q&A</h1>
    <p>Common questions and clear answers</p>
  </header>

  <main>

    <article>
      <h2>What is this website about?</h2>
      <p>
        This website provides simple questions and answers
        written in a clear and easy-to-read format.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article>
      <h2>Who is this website for?</h2>
      <p>
        It is designed for anyone looking for quick,
        straightforward explanations without unnecessary details.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article>
      <h2>How often is the content updated?</h2>
      <p>
        New questions and answers are added regularly
        to keep the information useful and relevant.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article>
      <h2>Can I use this information freely?</h2>
      <p>
        The content is written for general informational purposes
        and can be read and shared freely.
      </p>
    </article>

  </main>

  <footer>
    <p>© 2026 Simple Q&A</p>
  </footer>

</body>
